      "writtenOn": "2022-11-17T19:30:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: I recognize that this is what we called it in Ganesh, but this name is a bit of a mouthful. How do you feel about `useDedicatedImageMemory` or `alwaysUseImageMemory`? With, of course, respective changes to the `fShouldAlwaysUseDedicatedImageMemory` member attribute.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 52,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 52,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "f540babd691ad4d92823f7cff1ef748521df0175",
